":"beggar","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["beggar"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.10","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-57a92dcfe92d316cd6c9d273a61e9d0d","tos.text-unit.sid-57a92dcfe92d316cd6c9d273a61e9d0d"]},"form":"Anderes","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"source-use","neighbours":["great-noon","identity","circle","loneliness"],"line":{"ru":"Полдень приводит странника от жажды к желанию покоя.","en":"Noon leads the traveller from thirst to a desire for rest."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-cbca3c4a61fb282f2239ab51b47f8f88","tos.text-unit.sid-cbca3c4a61fb282f2239ab51b47f8f88"]},"form":"unterschied","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"source-use","neighbours":["great-noon","identity","necessity","counterfactual","attention"],"line":{"ru":"Многоголосый крик открывает учителю собственную пещеру.","en":"The many-voiced cry reveals the teacher’s own cave to him."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-edf510b73d30e20553009382d7baa660","tos.text-unit.sid-edf510b73d30e20553009382d7baa660"]},"form":"Andere","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-4d0f7408a6a794d4628d442bfbf3252b","tos.text-unit.sid-4d0f7408a6a794d4628d442bfbf3252b"]},"form":"Andere","speaker":"soothsayer","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["fate","identity","necessity","soothsayer"],"line":{"ru":"Звери отвечают учителю его формулой приоритета нужного.","en":"The animals answer the teacher with his formula of what is most needed."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-e50949ec9cf14355bbef787ebe7a8a3c","tos.text-unit.sid-e50949ec9cf14355bbef787ebe7a8a3c"]},"form":"andern","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["body-self","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-f698621fcba06ec5c79bc27c1b7a79a6","tos.text-unit.sid-f698621fcba06ec5c79bc27c1b7a79a6"]},"form":"Anderem","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","becoming","identity","ass"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-119c8c2ed52722a794122029f7afddbf","tos.text-unit.sid-119c8c2ed52722a794122029f7afddbf"]},"form":"anders","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-3ed09aeff9f4dfadfe38007727c84720","tos.text-unit.sid-3ed09aeff9f4dfadfe38007727c84720"]},"form":"Anderen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["identity","laughter","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель сам освящает свой смех венцом.","en":"The teacher sanctifies his own laughter with a crown."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.15","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-ee720c43290dabbf4e9d946e36c099bc","tos.text-unit.sid-0cc46bea184b9acff14c97c46ec65b25"]},"form":"Anderen","speaker":"magician","addressee":"conscientious","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"source-use","neighbours":["agency","magician"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.15","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-2f1c71872a008317158be602b6a5e57e","tos.text-unit.sid-2f1c71872a008317158be602b6a5e57e"]},"form":"verschieden","speaker":"conscientious","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["conscientious"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":