,"use":"narration","group":"source-use","neighbours":["courage","identity","earth"],"line":{"ru":"Ночная тишина приближает гостей к счастью земной жизни.","en":"Night’s silence brings the guests closer to earthly happiness."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.19","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-506672d69d74c231eab0ee3056459a6a","tos.text-unit.sid-506672d69d74c231eab0ee3056459a6a"]},"form":"anders","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","identity","counterfactual","attention","laughter","dance"],"line":{"ru":"Услышанный вопрос открывает гостям собственное выздоровление.","en":"The heard question reveals their own recovery to the guests."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.19","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-e88b79a4be3636968896a86c304c8eb4","tos.text-unit.sid-e88b79a4be3636968896a86c304c8eb4"]},"form":"andern","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","identity","attention","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Колокол собирает общее слушание людей, зверей и ночи.","en":"The bell gathers the shared listening of people, animals and night."}}]}
